    "body": "Additional log from the maintainer, 2026-11-16, given as the log \"from 2209\" (the test build of PR #2215), `fig8.camproj`, with an edge selected all around the part:\n\n```\n2026-11-16T18:28:23.679655Z  INFO camcraft_app::project::wire: project opened file=fig8.camproj bytes=1490947\ngpu: slow frame 170 ms (budget 100 ms, 1 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 77 ms [commands 18 ms, scene 77 ms, ui 72 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 150 ms (budget 100 ms, 23 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 83 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 83 ms, ui 65 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 145 ms (budget 100 ms, 56 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 77 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 77 ms, ui 66 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 1164 ms (budget 100 ms, 62 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 720 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 720 ms, ui 442 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 229 ms (budget 100 ms, 66 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 112 ms [commands 24 ms, scene 112 ms, ui 91 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 1298 ms (budget 100 ms, 84 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 654 ms [commands 183 ms, scene 654 ms, ui 459 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 1177 ms (budget 100 ms, 88 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 700 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 700 ms, ui 475 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 1171 ms (budget 100 ms, 93 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 706 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 706 ms, ui 463 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 1210 ms (budget 100 ms, 98 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 725 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 725 ms, ui 483 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 1160 ms (budget 100 ms, 103 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 685 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 685 ms, ui 474 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 1145 ms (budget 100 ms, 108 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 684 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 684 ms, ui 459 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 1167 ms (budget 100 ms, 113 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 698 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 698 ms, ui 467 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 1091 ms (budget 100 ms, 118 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 649 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 649 ms, ui 441 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 1129 ms (budget 100 ms, 122 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 657 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 657 ms, ui 471 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\ngpu: slow frame 1119 ms (budget 100 ms, 125 slow so far) - slowest phase \"scene\" 671 ms [commands 0 ms, scene 671 ms, ui 446 ms, acquire 0 ms, encode 0 ms, submit+present 0 ms]\n```\n\nFacts:\n\n- Before the selection the frames are 145 to 170 ms (`scene` about 80 ms, `ui` about 65 ms).\n- With the edge selected all around the part, each frame is 1090 to 1300 ms (`scene` 650 to 725 ms, `ui` 440 to 485 ms).\n- The cost is constant from frame to frame. Thus the work runs again in each frame and is not a one-time calculation at the click.\n- The two phases, `scene` and `ui`, each increase about 8 times. Each phase does work in proportion to the selected length or the piece count of the selection.\n\nThe edge join of PR #2215 does not remove this cost. The frame time is the work of #2201.\n",
